  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRChat Version: 2022.2.2p2c \nDescription of the bug: Since the Secure Instances update, there have been an increased number of reports of portals stuck at \"30s\". \nOne version of this occurs when the instance master drops a secure portal, leaves the instance, and instance master is transferred to someone who is not permitted to see the portal. In this scenario, the portal will never count down.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\n1. Instance master drops a friends+ secure portal\n2. Instance master enters the friends+ secure portal\n3. If instance master is transferred to a non-friend of the person who dropped the portal, the portal will never disappear for those who are authorized to see it (stuck at 30s).",
